  "interpretation": "<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" style=\"width: 98.6942%; height: 199.297px;\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"2478\">\n<thead data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1817\">\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2161px;\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1817\">\n<th style=\"width: 21.7972%;\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1734\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Result</th>\n<th style=\"width: 78.1803%;\" data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1817\" data-col-size=\"md\">Clinical Significance</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"2478\">\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2161px;\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"2038\">\n<td style=\"width: 21.7972%;\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1956\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Positive</td>\n<td style=\"width: 78.1803%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2038\">Indicates presence of t(14;18) translocation &mdash; commonly seen in:</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2161px;\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2148\">\n<td style=\"width: 21.7972%;\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2066\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 78.1803%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2148\">- Follicular lymphoma (~85% of cases)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2161px;\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2258\">\n<td style=\"width: 21.7972%;\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2176\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 78.1803%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2258\">- Some cases of DLBCL (Diffuse Large B-cell Lymphoma)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2161px;\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2368\">\n<td style=\"width: 21.7972%;\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2286\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Negative</td>\n<td style=\"width: 78.1803%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2368\">No evidence of BCL2/IGH fusion. Does not support follicular lymphoma.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 33.2161px;\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2478\">\n<td style=\"width: 21.7972%;\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2396\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 78.1803%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2478\">Further evaluation with IHC, morphology, or other molecular tests is advised.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
